<title>UK: World Bank sets 2.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 2.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    09.OCT.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.90	REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ   ONE COUPON</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    U.S.	HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
